# ============================================================
# Keep important source/configuration files
# ============================================================

# IMPORTANT:
# appsettings.json is intentionally NOT ignored.
# appsettings.json can contain shared application configuration.
#
# However, NEVER commit real passwords, API keys, JWT secrets,
# database passwords, connection strings containing credentials,
# or other sensitive production secrets.